<title>USA: TABLE - Elsag Bailey Q2 oper net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Elsag Bailey Q2 oper net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.09     loss	 $1.07</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,704     loss	29,833</p>
<p> Revs		     402,293		  416,172</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,202		   27,886</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.32     loss	 $4.59</p>
<p> Net loss		   9,235     loss     127,937</p>
<p> Revs		     748,019		  788,271</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,140		   36,840</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Excluding charges, Q2 1997 had a net profit of $14.2 million or $0.37 per share, fully diluted, vs profit $14.9 million or $0.40 for Q2 1996.</p>
<p>For Q2 1997 the company took a one-time, $12.9 million charge for reducing the workforce by over 200 employees, and completing the integration of Hartmann &amp; Braun.</p>
<p>For the first half of 1997, operating income was $44.7 million vs $53.5 million for first-half 1996.</p>
